# The Last Ride (Crew 2): Bot1's Memnite has power 1, below the crew cost of 2, so the crew ability is refused and the
# Vehicle stays a noncreature artifact (CR 702.122a); it is not -X/-X-ed to death, as only a creature is.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
The Last Ride
Memnite
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.The Last Ride.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Battlefield.The Last Ride.Activate(Ability: Crew 2)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = The Last Ride; Memnite
Bot1.Life = 20
